return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:56+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:56+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Boggan maktabadiisa warbaahinta waxay u guurineysaa keydinta shayada Zinn® waxayna ka soo adeegaysaa CDN. Laga soo habeeyey guddigaaga Zinn® — ma jiro furaha gelitaanka ee abid lagu qoro WordPress.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma soo celinin calaamad. Wax isbeddel ah laguma sameyn boggan.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Feylkaas lagama akhrin karo adeegahan, markaa waxba lama soo gelin.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d). The file is still on this server.'=>'Kaydku wuu diiday soo gelinta (HTTP %d). Faylku weli wuxuu ku jiraa adeegetan.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Boggan mar dambe kuma xirna Zinn® media offload. Soo-gelinta cusub waxay ku sii sugnaan doontaa server-kan. Mar labaad ka lammaane dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® waxay ku jawaabtay HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxaa jaray Zinn Digital®.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri buu