l copies'=>'Nuqullada maxalliga ah','Removed once every size has uploaded'=>'La tirtiray marka cabbir kasta la soo geliyo','Kept on this server'=>'Serverkan lagu hayo','Offloaded so far'=>'Isku-darka ilaa hadda','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'Faylasha %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Weli server-kan ayuu ku jiraa','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s oo ah %2$s lifaaqyada','Older media moves in the background, a few files an hour, and picks up where it left off. Nothing is deleted from this server unless your dashboard says so.'=>'Warbaahinta ka weyn waxay u guuraysaa taariikhda dambe, dhawr fayl saacaddii, waxayna ka bilaabanaysaa halkii ay ku joogsatay. Waxba lagama tirtiro seerfarkan ilaa uu dashboard-kaagu sidaas sheego mooyee.','Last problem'=>'Dhibaatadii ugu dambeysay','Disconnect this site'=>'Ka jar goobtan','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Soo-gelinta cusub waxay kuhaan doontaa server-kan. Warbaahinta horay loo raray waxay sii wadaysaa shaqada — cinwaankeedu ma beddelmayo.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Geli koodka lamaaneynta ee laga keenay dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Xiran. Soo-gelinta cusub waxa hadda wixii ka dambeeya lagu keydin doonaa Zinn Digital®, warbaahintaadii horena waxay u guuri doontaa xagga dambe.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Waa la gooyay. Warbaahinta horay loo raray way shaqeyneysaa; soo-gelinta cusub waxay ku sii sugnaan doontaa server-kan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka hufnaanta waxaana la rakibay.']];